         "rule_named": "integration by parts"
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "So the integral is \\( \\left[- \\frac{x e^{3 x}}{3} + \\frac{e^{3 x}}{9}\\right]_{0}^{2} = - \\frac{5 e^{6}}{9} - \\frac{1}{9} \\).",
